  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build an Orphan Care Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help Orphan Children inside Pakistan to get excess to quality education and living through a chain of Orphan Care Homes in different localities across Pakistan. According to reports, there are more than 4.5 million orphans in Pakistan, thus, Aghosh Homes provide shelter, food, clothes, education, recreational activities, physical/mental development and contributes in overall/holistic development of an orphan kid.</narrative>
  </description>
